---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: help_output(args)
---
A local-first, keyboard-native terminal client for Microsoft To Do

Usage: ms-todo [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  auth    Sign in to Microsoft, check the sign-in, or sign out
  lists   Your task lists
  tasks   Tasks in a list
  outbox  Writes waiting to reach Microsoft To Do, and those that didn't
  undo    Reverse a change: the last one by default, or the one with this op_id
  sync    Refresh the local cache from Microsoft To Do
  doctor  Check sign-in, the daemon, the local cache and each list's sync
  schema  Print the JSON schemas of a command's input and output (every command's without CMD)
  raw     Send an authenticated request straight to Microsoft Graph, for debugging
  daemon  Start, stop or check the background daemon that talks to Microsoft
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format: jsonl is one object per line, ids one ID per line, csv has a header row [default: table in a terminal, json when piped] [possible values: table, json, jsonl, ids, csv]
      --instance <NAME>  Use a separate copy of ms-todo's data (also MS_TODO_INSTANCE). Builds run from Cargo's target/ directory default to "dev"; "default" is the installed copy
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
